## 🧮 KPI Validation

The major KPIs were validated against the prepared hospital dataset.

### Total Admissions

The total number of admissions displayed on the dashboard was compared with the corresponding records in the final dataset.

**Validation Result:** ✅ Passed

### Total Discharges

The dashboard discharge count was compared with the source dataset.

**Validation Result:** ✅ Passed

### Occupancy Rate

The occupancy calculation was checked to ensure that the dashboard displayed the expected percentage based on the available hospital data.

**Validation Result:** ✅ Passed

### Average Length of Stay

The average patient stay was validated using the relevant admission and discharge information.

**Validation Result:** ✅ Passed

### Readmission Rate

The readmission calculation was checked against the defined readmission logic used during KPI engineering.

**Validation Result:** ✅ Passed

